00:08:52.899 --> 00:08:59.679
under both the CFTC and the Securities and Exchange Commission, or SEC, so only dual-registered

00:08:59.679 --> 00:09:05.199
venues can list them. Availability will roll out gradually on those dual-registered US exchanges,

00:09:05.759 --> 00:09:10.799
and Canadian investors can watch the new instruments through interactive brokers or similar cross-border

00:09:10.799 --> 00:09:16.659
platforms. The concrete read is leveraged single-name sentiment without holding the underlying shares,

00:09:16.659 --> 00:09:19.659
and without a margin account sitting on the stock itself.

00:09:20.239 --> 00:09:24.699
That is a positioning tape you can check before you sell a cash secured put against a name

00:09:24.699 --> 00:09:25.579
you already want.

00:09:26.079 --> 00:09:29.679
Not a substitute for the sharehold the rules will price at the next open.

